odes and freshdist; media/shared deps are read-held workflow aliases, not OSreadonly/selfcontained. Strict source approval only, no actual fit/art/default/300/humanfun claim.", "resourcePlan": {"assemblyMiB": 64, "buildWorkMiB": 384, "reserveMiB": 512, "diskMiB": 64, "heapMiB": 256, "stopSeconds": 55, "wholeSeconds": 60, "attempts": 1}, "emptyIntentSourceGate": {"path": "/workspace/scratch/native128-empty-intent-source-independent-r1/GATE.json", "bytes": 1537, "sha256": "092a2fed49d5441ce10c432284750c1404233a098ef1d4330c52d81a9f550ea5"}, "emptyIntentSourceAuthorPlan": {"bytes": 1572, "path": "/workspace/scratch/native128-empty-intent-source-author-root-r1/PLAN.json", "sha256": "23fd627d615ee9d8c6660d96e8fb93deab3a5074eed0c7f837bc3d89ed13474b"}}}
